sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant DSPO as DSPO Controller
    participant DB as MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP MySQL
    participant ObjStore as Object Store<br/>443 or 9000/TCP
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant APIServer as Pipeline API Server<br/>8888/TCP
    participant Argo as Argo Workflow Controller
    participant MLMD as MLMD gRPC Server<br/>8443/TCP mTLS

    Note over K8sAPI,DSPO: Flow 1: DSPA Reconciliation

    K8sAPI->>DSPO: DSPA CR watch event<br/>ServiceAccount token
    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Read Secrets, ConfigMaps<br/>Direct API calls (cache bypass)
    DSPO->>DB: Health check<br/>TLS configurable, DB credentials from Secret
    DB-->>DSPO: Connection OK
    DSPO->>ObjStore: Health check<br/>TLS configurable, Access key from Secret
    ObjStore-->>DSPO: Connection OK
    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Apply rendered manifests<br/>(manifestival templates)
    Note over DSPO,K8sAPI: Creates: Deployments, Services,<br/>Secrets, ConfigMaps, Routes,<br/>NetworkPolicies, RBAC

    Note over User,MLMD: Flow 2: Pipeline Execution

    User->>Route: POST pipeline run<br/>HTTPS TLS, OAuth/Bearer token
    Route->>APIServer: Forward request<br/>TLS termination at Route
    APIServer->>DB: Store pipeline metadata<br/>TLS, DB credentials
    APIServer->>ObjStore: Store/retrieve artifacts<br/>HTTPS, S3 credentials
    APIServer-->>Route: Pipeline run created
    Route-->>User: Response

    Argo->>K8sAPI: Create pipeline step Pods<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Argo: Pod scheduled
    Note over Argo: Pipeline steps execute<br/>as Workflow Pods
    Argo->>MLMD: Record artifact metadata<br/>gRPC, mTLS via Envoy
    MLMD-->>Argo: Metadata stored
